Descent 2's game data goes in this drawer
=========================================

D2X-Rebirth is the engine only. It needs the data files of Descent 2,
which are not included. Copy one of these sets into this drawer (Data,
beside the Descent2 program). Names may be in any case. The game also
finds them in the Descent2 drawer itself.

The full game (1.2, from your own CD or a store copy):

  descent2.hog
  descent2.ham
  descent2.pig    (and alien1.pig, alien2.pig, fire.pig, groupa.pig,
                   ice.pig, water.pig: copy every .pig there is)
  descent2.s11, descent2.s22   (sounds, if your copy has them)

  The movies, if you want them: intro-l.mvl (or intro-h.mvl),
  other-l.mvl, robots-l.mvl and the rest of the *.mvl files. Without
  them the game starts at the title screen.

The demo (Descent 2 shareware/demo 1.0, the first levels):

  d2demo.hog
  d2demo.ham
  d2demo.pig

  The demo has no movies, so there is no intro film.

Optional extras go here too: custom missions in a "missions" drawer you
make here, and demos in "demos".

The game writes its settings (descent.cfg), pilots (*.plr), saved games
and screenshots in the Descent2 drawer, so that drawer must not be
write-protected.
